hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1033","Abu Musa Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna told us, a spirit told us, Ibn Jurayj told us, Abdullah bin Musafa’ told me that Mus’ab bin?? Shaybah told him, on the authority of Uqba bin Muhammad bin Al-Harith, on the authority of Abdullah bin Jafar, on the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, he said: “Whoever forgets Any part of his prayer, let him prostrate two prostrations while sitting.” Thus said Abu Musa: On the authority of Uqba bin Muhammad bin Al-Harith. Abu Bakr said: This sheikh, the companions of Ibn Jurayj differ over his name. Hajjaj bin Muhammad and Abd al-Razzaq said: On the authority of Utbah bin Muhammad, and this is correct according to my knowledge."
